00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:53,240
 Godliness and peace, but when?

297
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:55,040
 Later on.

298
00:11:55,040 --> 00:11:57,920
 At the time, not pleasant, but painful.

299
00:11:57,920 --> 00:12:02,320
 But later on, it produces a harvest of godliness and peace.

