00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:37,800
 I mean, the palpable sense of revival and repentance

345
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:40,320
 and awakening, and even in these days,

346
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:42,200
 we say, Lord, do it again.

347
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:44,160
 Come again, come upon us again.

