00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:51,040
 I mean, and as I'm literally in this moment

351
00:14:51,040 --> 00:14:54,280
 watching this happen, if this isn't revival,

352
00:14:54,280 --> 00:14:55,240
 I don't know what is.

353
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:57,080
 Young people seeking God.

354
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:59,240
 We're living in such a unique moment.

355
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:02,440
 There's such a sense of God catalyzing, of breathing.

356
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:05,480
 We're just sensing and feeling and watching.

357
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:09,960
 We're walking in holy days in this moment.

358
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:12,360
 But as Jonathan Edwards would preach,

359
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:15,640
 he did so at the age of 42, preaching

