00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:08,720
 I love it, the three irrefutable reasons

381
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:13,960
 why Christians should be the happiest people in the world.

382
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:16,400
 As his outline, as you could imagine, these three reasons.

383
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:18,200
 And let me just condense them for you.

384
00:16:18,200 --> 00:16:21,200
 The first was the Christian should be the happiest person

385
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:25,980
 in the world because every hard thing that we ever

