00:16:25,980 --> 00:16:29,240
 go through in this world, God's going to use for good.

387
00:16:29,240 --> 00:16:30,320
 That's pretty good, right?

388
00:16:30,320 --> 00:16:32,440
 Why should you be the happiest person in the world?

389
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:34,320
 Because every, he says, bad thing you ever

390
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:37,200
 face in your life, God's going to use for good.

