00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:08,640
 But the glory God reveals through them,

405
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:10,920
 those things are going to last forever, right?

406
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:13,440
 So he says the second reason you should be the happiest

407
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:16,640
 person on the world is every actual good thing you ever

408
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:18,240
 receive in this world from God's hand,

409
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:19,920
 you'll get to keep it forever.

410
00:17:19,920 --> 00:17:23,160
 It's almost like we go through a metal detector into heaven

411
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:25,360
 and all the bad, like, oh, yeah, you're not coming.

412
00:17:25,360 --> 00:17:27,240
 But every good thing God did through the bad,

413
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:28,120
 that you get to keep.

414
00:17:28,120 --> 00:17:29,960
 That you can bring on in here.

