00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:33,320
 And then the third irrefutable reason

416
00:17:33,320 --> 00:17:35,520
 why the Christian should be the happiest person alive.

417
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:38,520
 Jonathan Edwards, 18 years old, he said is this.

