00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:30,000
 Paul knew better than anybody about heaven.

464
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:30,880
 How do you know that?

465
00:19:30,880 --> 00:19:35,440
 He got to go there one time, just like for the day.

466
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:36,880
 It's crazy.

467
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:40,000
 He died and got taken to heaven, and he

