00:20:17,960 --> 00:20:21,320
 And that's not theoretical or abstract for me.

482
00:20:21,320 --> 00:20:25,600
 I am 44 and 1/2 this year.

483
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:31,760
 When I turned 38, it was like going 60 miles an hour.

