00:20:31,760 --> 00:20:35,080
 I drove straight into a brick wall.

485
00:20:35,080 --> 00:20:42,080
 It happened like someone turned a light switch on at bedtime.

486
00:20:42,080 --> 00:20:45,640
 I started having panic attacks at 2 in the morning.

487
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:48,800
 If you've never had a panic attack, for me,

