00:20:56,960 --> 00:21:00,520
 I was looking at my watch, just so confused,

492
00:21:00,520 --> 00:21:03,160
 felt like I was going to die.

493
00:21:03,160 --> 00:21:07,520
 And that began for me a season that from beginning

