00:21:10,560 --> 00:21:13,280
 enough to where I could actually talk about it in the past tense,

496
00:21:13,280 --> 00:21:15,720
 it lasted about 18 months long.

497
00:21:15,720 --> 00:21:21,440
 That was one of the most bewildering periods in my life.

498
00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:25,560
 And the most perplexing part about that season

499
00:21:25,560 --> 00:21:27,880
 was there was nothing I could point to

500
00:21:27,880 --> 00:21:30,160
 as to why it was going on.

501
00:21:30,160 --> 00:21:33,920
 If you break a leg, which the year we planted our church

