00:21:40,840 --> 00:21:43,800
 Well, my leg, biggest bone in my body, yeah,

507
00:21:43,800 --> 00:21:45,480
 sort of broken in half.

508
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:46,520
 My leg's pointed that way.

509
00:21:46,520 --> 00:21:49,400
 Not so much this way, mostly that way.

510
00:21:49,400 --> 00:21:50,920
 You know what I'm saying?

511
00:21:50,920 --> 00:21:52,920
 And why are you having a hard time?

512
00:21:52,920 --> 00:21:53,880
 Well, my femur's broken.

513
00:21:53,880 --> 00:21:54,600
 Oh, cool.

514
00:21:54,600 --> 00:21:55,200
 Amazing.

515
00:21:55,200 --> 00:21:57,640
 Well, please have a seat.

516
00:21:57,640 --> 00:21:58,320
 Oh, excellent.

517
00:21:58,320 --> 00:21:59,080
 I think I will.

518
00:21:59,080 --> 00:21:59,580
 Yeah.

519
00:21:59,580 --> 00:22:05,120
 My daughter, my second-born daughter died in my arms

520
00:22:05,120 --> 00:22:08,600
 five days before Christmas, five years into our church plant.

